  "expertText": "* = $0801\n.region init\n; SEI\n; JSR $E544\n; LDA #$17\n; STA $D018\n.set_border 6\n.clear_screen\n.charset lower\n\n.endregion\n; TEXT auto: lowercase input → mixed case encoding\n.text 14, 8, \"hello c64!\", lower\n.text 10, 12, \"Visual Assembler\", lower\n.text 10, 18, \"HELLO WORLD\", lower\n    RTS",
